  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Young African Leaders Initiative (YALI) - AGRI INVEST</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The real challenge of competitive rice production and marketing in Cameroon relies on a quality product and the emergence of more professional farms. AGRI-INVEST LLC aims to progressively respond to the issue by channeling the existing local production of rice to the domestic market while ensuring a quality processing (and increasing gradually its capacity) and supervise, train farmers on their farming activity to boost their production on a professional way., ,</narrative>
  </description>
